<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607329420" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588840447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 May 2020 08:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00436/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把M1911手枪。使用时，将枪口对准一名手中持有任意复杂器械的人员，按下扳机后项目将使目标手中的复杂器械被解体成零件。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>混沌分裂者三号哨站<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>无效化。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>以后不准有人随便拿异常照镜子，除非经过了授权。</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00436" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00436" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00436-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285604); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607329420" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6285604); return false;">Chris Evertworth</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602166748 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Oct 2020 14:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只自我收容的逆模因家猫（<em>Felis catus</em>），无法被标准认知阻值低于13者察觉。在叼走客座研究员Rachud的早餐后因后者在工作中使用了记忆强化剂而发现。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2015/██/█<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-75附近<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>在站点员工的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">胁迫</span>意愿下，研究员Rachud利用工作之便诱导其每天定时从Site-CN-75-B一处后门中获取食物，食物的费用由所有员工共同负担。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>莫名其妙，看不见的猫有什么好吸的。</em>——研究员Rachud</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00034" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00034" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00034-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4516971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607329420" alt="Rachud" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4516971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;">Rachud</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586172967 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Apr 2020 11:36</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一套羽毛球拍，当有人使用其任意一把时所有对方的发球都使使用者无法击中羽毛球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家羽毛球馆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被陈列于Site-CN-12的低价值物品保存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>nmd，哪个[数据删除]的在我和 ██站友谊赛的时候换成这玩意的？</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00375" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00375-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6031220&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607329420" alt="nirvana073" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6031220)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;">nirvana073</a></span></p>
